{title: Na Kajre Ki Dhar}
{artist: Mohra Pankaj Udhas}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]naa kajare [D]kee dhaar,
[Em]naa motiyon [D]ke haar
[C]naa koee [D]kiyaa singaar,
[Em]fir bhee kitanee sundar ho
[Em]man mein [D]pyaar bharaa,
[Em]aur tan [D]mein pyaar bharaa
[C]jeewan mein [D]pyaar bharaa,
[Em]tum to mere priyawar ho
[D]singaar [Em]teraa yauwan
[Em]yauwan hee teraa gahanaa
[D]too taajagee [Em]foolon kee,
[Em]kyaa saadagee ka kahanaa
[A]ude khushaboo [Em]jab chale too,
[Em]bole to baje sitaar
[D]saaree [Em]duniyaan harajaaee,
[Em]tere pyaar mein hain sachchaaee
[D]is liye [Em]chhod ke duniyaa,
[Em]tere or kheenchee chalee aaee
[A]thee patthar, [Em]toone chhookar,
[Em]sonaa kar diyaa kharaa
[D]teraa ang [Em]sachchaa sonaa,
[Em]muskaan sachche mote
[D]tere honthh [Em]hain madhushaalaa,
[Em]too rup kee hain jyoti
[A]teree soorat [Em]jaise moorat
[Em]main dekhoo baar baar
